{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-19_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-19",
  "title": "The Archon in Sanguine",
  "storyCode": "13-21",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e12998c77cac84b99d2669bcd3c6fa2e032886e3a5d0d101f4f98999b06eaf8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "What... is that...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "The blessing the Sanguinarch left the Sarkaz hasn't faded, but just now—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Could the Doctor have been talking about...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "...Hoederer, W, look alive!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Do it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "W, where are the bombs you buried? Hit your detonator, now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Don't have to tell me twice!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "No guesses, Hoederer! We only take on opponents we know we can handle!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "...I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "W's bombs tore through the defensive line. We've got a breakthrough. Tangled with them way too long.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Amiya and Logos went on ahead of us. They'll deal with the worst of our troubles.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "As for the others... follow the path they cleared and climb the Feranmut's bones with those gangways!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "Dammit, these guys—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "Don't let them get any further! Commander Ulšulah is pulling up the gangways!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "The traitors die here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "We'll take their corpses to the tent of the Nachzehrer King, to nourish our next victory!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Buried mines under the bones. Feels pretty good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hoederer, Ines, get ready—Shockwave incoming!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "W, three grenades, downward diagonal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Ugh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Good idea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "This is the last time I play along with your explosive shenanigans.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "This way to the core of the skeleton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Our target is Ulšulah. Find her, and we get control of this thing we're walking on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Are you two sure we can 'get' this skeleton? Sounds a little reckless, almost like robbing a caravan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "We have to. Otherwise,, Amiya and Logos are fighting for nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "So we open the car door, toss the driver out, grab the keys—'Bam, my car now'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Did you see the illusions this thing made, moving between its bones, you still haven't figured anything out?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "This isn't some obscure story.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Should I have figured something out?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "I forgot, you don't care to learn history.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "A few hundred years ago, the Sarkaz killed a Feranmut that almost destroyed Kazdel.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "After it fell, there were various claims as to where it ended up, and one of those was—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "That its consciousness didn't die with it, that it was split up, sealed into a bunch of different items.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Now it seems that claim was probably at least partly true. As for the unconscious shell... it was carefully collected before this war.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "They spent a lot of effort to modify it, and sure enough, it's playing a big role in the war for the Military Commission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "'Different items', huh? Ulšulah never carried a pocket watch before. Not like she was ever on time in the Scar Market.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "But if her watch is holding the Feranmut's consciousness... it's probably already very fragmented.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "The skeleton we're standing on isn't exactly dead, but it doesn't have much more than basic nerve reflexes. Ulšulah can only guide those basic reactions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "We just need to pay more attention to them—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Take cover!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Sure, just avoid the nerve bundles that can strike at you, and watch out for sudden bone spear thrusts, nothing to worry about.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "After all, this fella's been stripped down to nothing but bleached bones.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "But there's still you, Ulšulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "You're more dangerous than this half-dead Feranmut.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Done with your important work?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "I might be, if you weren't here to bother me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Is this bitch the commander here? She's pretty rough on her own skeleton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Those bolts are all stuck in the bones now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Want me to help pull 'em out? I've got a pretty handy method.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*—It's that psycho!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Trying to kill my men right in front of me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Hoederer, you think too little of me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Ugh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "You've gotten rusty, Ulšulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "I guess you've been doing well for yourself in the Scar Market.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "You're a bunch of survivors, I'll give you that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Back in Kazdel, I made quiet bets with the old timers on how many of you would actually collect on those jobs you were taking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "As long as I bet on Hoederer, Ines, and later the psycho W, I always made money.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Sounds to me like you owe us a big cut.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "That's the famous sharp tongue on <i>this</i> W. Haven't you learned anything from Ines?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "This time, though, you took a wrong turn.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Two kings of the Royal Court are here, going all out, not to mention the 'King of Sarkaz'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "This place is never gonna be a safe haven where you can escape the war, not the kind of place you can survive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "What about you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "You heard about Theresis's trump card in Londinium?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Assuming... the consequences out there are way beyond anything anyone's ever seen before, you still think it's a fair price to pay for the Sarkaz to rebuild Kazdel?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "...That's enough chit-chat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Soldiers, end them here, while there's still time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "Major, look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "On the bones there...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "It's the Sanguinarch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Looks like he's ready.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "So much blood...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Ulšulah, where did all this blood come from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "As if you need to ask. It's courtesy of that homicidal Sanguinarch. He slaughtered the place clean.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "No, their wrists...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "'I offer Your Highness my blood, Prince of the Crimson Court.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spine Guardian",
      "text": "'May you hunt unimpeded.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "'Let our blood form for you a swift chariot.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Ulšulah, stop! Have you lost your marbles?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "The Feranmut... it's about to move again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "The currents of history might be about to sweep this place away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "That bitch wants to go down with us—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "I am not controlling it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Blood has replaced muscle, tendons, and marrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Isn't that enough to control it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "It's been an honor and a privilege, men, you stood with me to the end. We will meet again among the myriad souls.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "I told you, this skeleton isn't a place to escape, it isn't a place to survive anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Hurry! We need to take cover in the cabin!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "The illusions are already manifesting, we don't know where they might go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "—It's creating waves! Look out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "Ugh, where does the Vampire want to take us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hoederer?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "I'm here, with her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "She's lost too much blood. Whether or not she lives is all up to her now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "You might as well leave me outside, Hoederer. I'd rather die with my men.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "You've killed so many 'old friends', there's no way you suddenly grew a heart today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "We can use you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "I told you, the skeleton's out of my control now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "You also said you're loyal to the Commission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "If you think the Military Commission is the hope for Kazdel to become a nation... then why is that guy calling himself a regent?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Why does he need Theresa? Why does he think winning this war will secure a future for Kazdel?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "What is Theresis thinking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Whatever, we'll talk after we take down this Feranmut.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "What... are you going to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Our goal hasn't changed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "We're going home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Heh... home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "That was supposed to be the skeleton's last mission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "What...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "It has a name. We codenamed it <i>Lifebone.</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Nobody uses it much, but when General Manfred named it... he was talking just like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Just like me? Manfred...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "We're enemies, so I'm done with questions. I'm just gonna wait to die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "Well, heh, I guess making it to today is a kind of an answer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "You really think General Manfred is blind? That he doesn't know what you're up to?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "text": "I mean, you can only talk about going home if you manage to survive your run-in with the Sanguinarch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "You're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So—\nI'm gonna borrow your watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "It really is... louder than I imagined.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Feranmut who wanders this land, you are not dead, you've decided to continue your existence in a different way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "You're still here, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "Stop, Feranmut.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "You are about to step into Kazdel, our city. The people here refuse your visit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "Choose another path.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "Or else, the Sarkaz will slaughter you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "This is your only warning.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feranmut",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "Very well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "My brother directed us to forbid its advance, to obey the will of the King of Sarkaz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Vampire?",
      "text": "Sanguine Court, to me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "After those illusory visions and memories of the past, you've indeed brought me a more... valuable scene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Why don't the two of you, in the face of such a scene, fizzle those frankly laughable Arts in your hands?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Have a look around, take some time to admire it all—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "This... is the tomb I have chosen for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It was daytime just a moment ago, but here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "A dark night, and an endless sea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "The stars are changing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "I've never heard of any place like this, not in any records, not in any legends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "So, this must be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Distant enough, yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "I do wonder how far we are from Kazdel now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "This land they all call Terra, is it too vast, or is it too small?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "Amiya, be careful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "His blood... it's sublimating.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "He awakened his blood with that witchcraft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Don't talk like an outblood, Banshee.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "You know, I treat purebloods as equals.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Perhaps, when compared to the Crimson Court, which has spent eons seeking purity, you have been more deeply influenced by Originium.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "But, well, among the Sarkaz, you are indeed quite... formidable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Come, let's not be stingy with my blessing, you cannot reject my gift. Now that I've awakened your power, you are finally worthy of facing me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Let me hear the screech of your knell, if it can still darken the moonlight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "'I write, therefore, I command.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "'The night conceals me from death.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Another incantation...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Another of your shallow incantations.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "You have talent, no doubt about that. The flapping of your lips and the doodles of your bone pen are enough to humiliate the so-called Originium 'Arts' of common people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "And yet, why do you resist your heritage so?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Show me your true self, King of the Court, Banshee!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Duq'arael, Sanguinarch of Vampires, Prince of all Blood, demands you show your true self!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Enough, Vampire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Hold on, Logos—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Oh, <i>King of Sarkaz.</i> I nearly forgot you were here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Cautus, <i>King.</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Look at you, you didn't receive even a scrap of my boon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Cautus blood, tedious and ordinary. No matter how hard I try to scrape something together, I can't find a shred of talent or power.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "I can't even say that your blood is mixed or impure, as those adjectives still imply an expectation of return to purity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "But you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Heh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "There are chaotic bloodlines I approve of, but they are without a doubt all 'formidable' or 'magnificent'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "But what do you have? A laughable motivation? A shallow conviction?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I don't have to answer you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I just have to defeat you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Is this our <i>King of Sarkaz?</i> Just stealing a bit of attainment from another, chaotic, and disorderly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "Nothing even on the level of the Banshee's little tricks born of his rebellious mind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "—Even less than that pair of siblings.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "Amiya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "Don't let him provoke you. As it stands, his power is still growing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "text": "We need to end this fast.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We need to get back under clear skies.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "In the past...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "I once slew a so-called 'King of Sarkaz', and it wasn't particularly difficult.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "And I suspect your end will be the same, this time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "You question me with black blades.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "text": "I answer you with the gift of death.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
